    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783150/extras/fb79cd0063138f92bf47b7b69e8b7322.avif?t=1706717158\" width=552 height=164 /></span><br><br>You are the new manager of Stardustry, the pinnacle of resource extraction and production in outer space!<br><br>Mine asteroids for ore, process them into more complex resources and build the most efficient production line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783150/extras/20dda7b13613e7b36a60cac48d5a836f.avif?t=1706717158\" width=552 height=164 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783150/extras/c53a25d62e9442d70664aa76cf6c0ef2.poster.avif?t=1706717158\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783150/extras/c53a25d62e9442d70664aa76cf6c0ef2.webm?t=1706717158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783150/extras/c53a25d62e9442d70664aa76cf6c0ef2.mp4?t=1706717158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Identify the ore veins, place extractors and plan your production and delivery route, place bots and automate your production line to reach your goal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783150/extras/bfdd787713fa154a189c481572aa8be3.avif?t=1706717158\" width=552 height=164 /></span><br><br>Stardustry is in the works at this moment. We are working on finishing the first campaign before making the first release.",
